      <span style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:12px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:2px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;background:rgba(143,208,234,0.18);color:#F0BE78;border:1px solid rgba(143,208,234,0.3);">Service Area</span>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#fff;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,52px);margin:0 0 18px;">Solar Installation in Port Harcourt</h1>
      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Rainy months cut solar output, so a Port Harcourt system has to be sized for July, not January. Get two or three written quotes that name the exact inverter, battery and panel models.</p>
