<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>If you live in Port Harcourt, in GRA, Rumuola, Eliozu, Woji or out towards Choba, you know the routine: PHED light goes, the gen comes on, and petrol money disappears. Solar installation in Port Harcourt can carry part of that load, but only when the system is sized for the city's long rainy season and for the appliances you actually run.</p><p>This site installs nothing. It is advertising for independent installers, and this page tells you what to ask them. Read about <a href="/home-solar-installation/">home solar installation</a> or <a href="/inverter-battery-installation/">inverter and battery installation</a>, then call now on <strong>+234 809 000 0000</strong> and tell us what you run. An independent installer will quote the job.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Do in Port Harcourt</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">Services for Port Harcourt Properties</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Home solar installation</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">A hybrid system for a duplex or flat in GRA, Rumuola, Eliozu or Woji, sized from your own appliances' rating plates. The independent installer does the load audit before any quote.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Inverter and battery installation</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Replace tubular batteries that no longer last the night, or add a hybrid inverter to the panels you already have. Ask for the battery model and the maker's stated cycles in writing.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Commercial solar</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Shops, schools, clinics, churches and small offices, including around Trans-Amadi, that want to cut diesel and petrol. Expect a load audit and a clear list of what runs on solar and what stays on the gen.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Solar and inverter repair</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">A system that keeps tripping, or a battery that dies early. An independent installer should check protection, earthing and battery health and give you a written diagnosis before any parts are bought.</p>
      </div>
</div>
